🚀 Getting Started

You can create your own version of the birthday website in a few steps.

Option 1: Download the project

Open this repository on GitHub.
Click Code.
Select Download ZIP.
Extract the downloaded folder.
Open the project folder.
Open index.html in a modern web browser.

You can also clone the repository using Git:

git clone YOUR_REPOSITORY_URL
cd YOUR_PROJECT_FOLDER

Replace the placeholders with the actual repository URL and folder name.

Option 2: Use GitHub directly

If you are comfortable with GitHub, fork the repository or create your own copy, edit the files, and publish your personalized version using GitHub Pages.
Important: Keep the original project structure unless you also update the file paths in the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

