❤️ The Idea Behind This Project

A birthday surprise does not have to be expensive or complicated to be meaningful.
Sometimes, the best gift is the time spent remembering the little things: the photographs, the jokes, the conversations, the moments that mattered, and the words you do not always get to say.
This project is a way to bring those things together into one small digital experience.
Customize it for someone important to you, make it your own, and share it with them on their special day.
Make it personal. Make it meaningful. Make it with love. 💌


